---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Work with me | BlazorPerformance.com" description="Advisory, training, and conference speaking on Blazor and enterprise .NET scalability and performance.">
  <div class="eyebrow">Work with me</div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Advisory, training & speaking</h1>
  <p class="page-sub" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
    The tools and playbooks on this site are free and always will be. For teams
    that want hands-on help, I occasionally take on engagements in:
  </p>

  <div class="grid-2 engagements">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Capacity & scalability reviews</h2>
      <p>Architecture and sizing assessment for Blazor Server / .NET workloads before a launch, migration, or procurement decision.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Performance investigations</h2>
      <p>Structured root-cause work on memory growth, latency, and throughput problems in production systems.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Team training</h2>
      <p>Practical workshops on capacity planning, performance measurement, and scalability engineering for enterprise .NET teams.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Conference & event speaking</h2>
      <p>Talks on scalability, performance engineering, and technology leadership. An experienced speaker at PMI Global and chapter events, user groups, and industry conferences; available for keynotes, sessions, and panels.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="lunch-callout">
    <h2>Prefer something lighter than a formal workshop?</h2>
    <p>
      These topics also work well as lunch-and-learn sessions. <a href="https://learnatlunch.today">LearnAtLunch.Today</a>, our
      peer-learning platform, makes it easy to run bite-sized 30&ndash;45 minute knowledge-sharing
      sessions inside your organization, on performance engineering or anything else
      your team wants to teach each other.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="closing">
    If that's useful to your team, write to <a href="mailto:info@vadami.ai?subject=BlazorPerformance%20engagement%20inquiry">info@vadami.ai</a> with
    a short description of what you're facing. I read everything, and I'll
    tell you honestly, including when the free playbooks already cover what you need.
  </p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:info@vadami.ai?subject=Working%20together">Get in touch</a>
</Base>

<style>
  .engagements { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .engagements h2 { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink-900); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .engagements p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-500); }
  .lunch-callout {
    background: var(--ink-100); border: 1px solid var(--ink-200);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px 24px; margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 920px;
  }
  .lunch-callout h2 { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-900); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .lunch-callout p { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-500); }
  .closing { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-600); max-width: 44em; margin-bottom: 20px; }
</style>
